2025 

* On [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|1/12/2025]], the Hero Knight was added to the game along with 3 other Heroes:  [[Giant/Hero|Giant]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A./Hero|Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], and [[Musketeer/Hero|Musketeer]]{{Balance|Add}}.

2026

* On 12/1/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/1/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Knight's shield hitpoints by 6%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 2/3/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the radius of Triumphant Taunt to 6.5 tiles (from 7.5 tiles){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 6/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Taunt Trigger Window to 0.1s (from 0.7s){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 6/7/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/7/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Knight's shield hitpoints by 33%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], made the ability single use (from 20sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

